  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Resident Coordinator&apos;s Office in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with the overall Danish policy for international organisations, the project aims at strengthening the setup of the Resident Coordinators Office with the overall objective of advancing the appropriateness of the nexus response in Lebanon through strengthened response leadership, coordination and communication.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is identification and implementation of key &#x2018;transitional&#x2019; measures and revised aid architecture to enhance the accountability, effectiveness and onward communication of the nexus response in Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
